{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "0f9f8266b892dc7e595d36f0e546e73507ec461a9b57a4f68f2e87dcdf74368b", "ja": "生配信のススメ", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3daae070e27b0efd42550cd3d66879023ce794a56de21730e35095d9e7ee0895", "ja": "対戦相手に触発され、生配信にチャレンジす\nる一同。だが、経験不足からグダグダに……\n一人だけ、杏奈のゲーム実況は大いに盛り上\nがる。慣れもあるが、好きなことをやってい\nるだけ、と語る杏奈。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "764862ef5b73b38c93bfbb9c9acb6b175afebe5a509afb6a621979b1006c21cc", "ja": "（3人から、765プロチャンネルの生放送枠を\n使って、配信をしてみたいとの打診があった）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8e4f1a3a3bdeca8b2bee67aba3d386c856a93c3b51f600053f800544f9996f79", "ja": "（ライバルの配信番組に影響を受けたみたいだ。\nぜひともその熱意で突き進んでもらおう！）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "357a69216d2ba2185186d70aa8740af9039cd74a975205f1fe94e864f4450acb", "ja": "こんにちは！　765プロチャンネルの時間です。\nお相手は、春日未来と～……", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "c08e7e773d8ea18d8146a8a20336b40009d86008cb89ee76c23d0e5d4e873629", "ja": "矢吹可奈でーす！　今日は生放送の練習なんですよ。\n生放送～♪　ほうれんそう～♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b08c93d5082fbba9c6734fdad14943114a0721b6a6420cd6e276508ec7172298", "ja": "白石紬です。至らない点も多いかと思いますが、\n温かく見守っていただければ幸いです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1005_null", "source_sha256": "972dccf1d5cecfa1890a7678c4a8dbcb8879f24463c4dd0c51a15c39e8841f5e", "ja": "（間）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "5d145559da12cd19fc137f0d57c47a9a4be80076ae6e98118a3ab43429cab4b6", "ja": "……あっ！　ジングルないんだった。\nえっと～……じゃあ、コメント読もっか！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "9a693ea2efbcc5d0b8cae0be320893cfee33b6012360d50fa73fbff936b47ec4", "ja": "えっ？　まだコメント来てないかも……\n始まったばっかりだし。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "79cddf6df919fec7bb6147aabc0f5c86a5e3c1eea8724bf4e27fa6f88b0fa9f4", "ja": "そ、そっか！　じゃあ……フリートークで！\n可奈、なんか話題ない？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "288d46d14dac0158f46c685b0ac06e0ce458e994b155dfaef6f7303f7085ed06", "ja": "ええーっ！？\nえっと、わ、話題？　……うう～ん……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a2cee69315a1b09231af52b8b87691ed1fce3bc5083f54b6e02f3bb7051d0d61", "ja": "そ、そういえば先日、劇場からの帰りに、\nコンビニで新商品のパンを買ったのですが……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "8e696f49a659cf5d9fd1b8fe8e8a5353004c68eeb13ce03fa6cbfff57bbb64a7", "ja": "わーっ、そうなんだ！？\n紬ちゃん、それでそれで？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "050472591a349def4b7f2c5c0deed0040f26c43f98484211850ad8eaceed490c", "ja": "それが、とても美味しかったのです。\n……あの、終わりです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1e45c490c2c53bff38a4d756a23328e1e3c87ff0cb68fde7426ed8b5d6f77892", "ja": "……盛り上がりませんでしたね。うぅ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "5ed1d5595b817895f059a5f26ed7c98af539c8163318c1fb047f67ed7aef1495", "ja": "あっ、コメントが来てる！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "76be7c657c4bc9a11ddadb5823a649e1e00802f705947fa94a2d31e83050697e", "ja": "ホント！？　読む読む！　えーっと……\n『音量ミスってない？　声、小さいかも』……だって！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "98e86ac78607b45547700eb02e4d82f2e563df5a50672d6f5bd990ced7997cb1", "ja": "はれっ！？　ど、どうしよう？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "b6e9be938bbb7df065774d2e2438bd70938da0c231709bf6fae0faeed6279590", "ja": "とりあえず、大きい声出しとく？\nすーっ…………こーんーにーち、はーっ！！！！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0375c6e698e3317eecd23bf350cafb250a22a8f3916287b99703f670c4bd4418", "ja": "春日さん！？　そういう問題では……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "10ba2ecdec0e44a9830d4b83f7c6d4ea969b6f1ee62808975e384dcc4d49b293", "ja": "……ふぅ、これで大丈夫そうです。\n機材のチェックは、事前にしておくべきでした……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "85dc1335ee43b2b4442daf3c5710daeaedfb045195347e8c3eafc5494c7e88d1", "ja": "うぅ、グダグダだ～……\n配信って難しいな～、内心焦ってるな～♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1022_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "52dcef9932aac6d2e201617039660868ac8fb3f2f5f176fd579707db977fd7d2", "ja": "あ、やってるやってる！　みんな、やっほー♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "ccea574718df96b9e52ca8c4f8e00cd14c93883838256054ef6fdcf9c083c710", "ja": "あれっ！？　杏奈！　お休みは？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "5d15e6526168f760f644041ff22899823438e2c5f30d6c420009277604e93f90", "ja": "みんなが配信してるって聞いて、ビビッと\n遊びに来ちゃいました！　杏奈も入っていい？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "003a5df407e765f94798d153d18930ccc924ff0354a47350f2534fd83a82fc79", "ja": "もちろん～！　今、何しようか悩んでたんだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "26c7368eff82a599ba82d77265e65a27b98a099c7cea2eedb0722c94dd3a2b49", "ja": "ありがとー！　そしたら杏奈、ゲーム休暇が一段落した\nところだし、今度はゲーム実況しちゃうよ♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "304ad2bce262adafb7e85b8fe407c21354f0118b9c52eb4900023f1d2ff2cf11", "ja": "ゲームが一段落したから、ゲームを……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "a27dc5dbfd78d9d24637d783fc2c4e62d904e13e783faca2e1a067b0ce6918a2", "ja": "画面共有オッケー！　じゃあ今日は、\nこちらのゲームをやっていこうと思いまーす！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "fc01f38703786034ab1764ed0683aa8cc1798fda609d279cb7e7adfd52c00224", "ja": "あれ、これって難しいやつだよね？\n杏奈が歯応えあるって言ってたような……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "9cb4f0494d86bad30c086ed66ddae3d3610c792a5cd7d23e301227bfe7e3b3ab", "ja": "うん！\nよく見ててね……いっくよ～！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1032_se", "source_sha256": "545cd3b7e6ffc659c2e871b75cf9afeb9341e2464b01c8fdb4872182c92d84ce", "ja": "カチャカチャカチャ……", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "2e4f02d8c21c37cb6c1b2f529c3fed98835d340d220aabfe0bdb0f3fa820e6bd", "ja": "えっ……たった一発で、\n敵が全部消えちゃった！？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "241594ac41bd479142129f46b5bcd526bf183dbd520245d2cf3a66deef2ed110", "ja": "んー……やっぱり今回は『爪』でいこうかな。\nみんなどういうファームが好きか、コメントしてね！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ace27612b8c97c4b8ae92e5deb9f5eaf890c90ab4478baa202879bea82736c77", "ja": "ふぁーむ……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "3b14ad8a3bb32c2bc22392fd5c01e4e5a5de224cf7678b168d3a2bcb04513c3e", "ja": "えっと、キャラの育成ってこと！\nここでプレイングに差がつくんだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "0594fb54f0ea23b78fd143f5cff584a48699c430a59c22120a0871dab869b9a6", "ja": "『寺院ルート行くんだ？』うん！　慣れれば安定するし\n武器拾えるし、杏奈は積極的に行っちゃうかな！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "6d8eaadbf544bd3abb12443efe837d7cf7f0b604d7c5fd5abb12e32023d471c2", "ja": "プレイ中なのにコメントすぐ読んですぐ返してる……。\n杏奈ちゃん、すごいな～。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1039_024ann", "source_sha256": "b014c00a596670927d2d5f6a29e8638ca9a0e602f35524a8f56fcb6c810ce38b", "ja": "『恩讐ちゃんむずいよね』そう、Tierは低いけど、\nうまくビルド組めた時は気持ちいいんだよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "13cf8ad2aa121cb08f05888e44dd7d32a088a22ebc0c0cfa4aaa7cad40c96a12", "ja": "スキンも可愛いし、この子好きなんだ♪\nあとね、専用BGMがすっごくいいの！　聞いてて！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1041_se", "source_sha256": "545cd3b7e6ffc659c2e871b75cf9afeb9341e2464b01c8fdb4872182c92d84ce", "ja": "カチャカチャカチャ……", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0aad8f002cb3cb0216dec7bf1721c340f6d27076825945d34d3ff88cc1d87c07", "ja": "あ……いつの間にか、人がこんなに？\nコメントも、目で追いきれません……がんこな……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1044_014mir", "source_sha256": "febe91039386a5ffb8d12648bb11330f809ae72e88448820d68bd2a0e3496b7e", "ja": "みんな、配信お疲れさま！\nは～……杏奈って、やっぱりすごいなぁ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1045_036kan", "source_sha256": "ed5cd3e4291538b1fb026f8b17a3efd210c9482f1405e6aef4ea6b17d194d388", "ja": "ねー、私たちだけの時と、全然違ったもん。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_04_1046_024ann", "source_sha256": "3b6e4b46d5bad99dcccabcb1755d08499c98d2fef1f270b2dd9758d6a71d8bf6", "ja": "杏奈、ゲーム好きだし……実況動画も好き、だから……\n好きなこと、やってただけ、だよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
